    "text": "Starting fresh can significantly alter our psychological state, as research shows that fresh starts—like the beginning of a new year or a new month—activate the brain's reward system, making us feel more motivated and optimistic about achieving our goals. This phenomenon is often referred to as the 'fresh start effect', where people are more likely to pursue their aspirations when they perceive a new beginning.",
